                       "description":  "The password field has special security behavior: the actual password is stored in the OS keychain (Windows Credential Manager, macOS Keychain, Linux Secret Service), never in the plaintext settings.json file. When loading settings, the Rust backend returns \u0027********\u0027 in the test_password field if a password is stored. Saving \u0027********\u0027 unchanged does not overwrite the real password. Saving null/empty clears the password from the keychain.",
