                       "source":  "migrated",
                       "appId":  "qontinui-runner"
                   },
    "description":  "Playwright settings tab within the runner Settings panel. Configures authentication credentials and environment variables for Playwright test execution. Contains two card sections: \u0027Test Authentication\u0027 (username/email + password with show/hide toggle) and \u0027Environment\u0027 (base URL + skip web server toggle). Password is stored securely in the OS keychain and displayed as \u0027********\u0027 on load. Settings are persisted via Tauri IPC commands (get_playwright_settings / save_playwright_settings). The four settings fields map directly to environment variables passed to Playwright tests: PLAYWRIGHT_TEST_USERNAME, PLAYWRIGHT_TEST_PASSWORD, PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL, and SKIP_WEB_SERVER.",
